<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal budget deficit seen below forecast Q1.</title>
<headline>Portugal budget deficit seen below forecast Q1.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's budget deficit totalled 272 billion escudos over the first three months of 1997, 20 billion escudos less than forecast, the Finance Ministry said on Friday.</p>
<p>The figure is not comparable with 1996.</p>
</text>
